 26++ 64BA CD A5 65             call    DS12887_OPEN
 27++ 64BD CD 5C 65             call    DS12887_READ_STATUS
 28++ 64C0                      ; A floating/unimplemented port often reads FF. A valid DS12887
 29++ 64C0                      ; has Status D exactly 80h and Status A divider bits 010b.
