 33++ 64C5                      ; ATM710 emulators may expose the same Dallas CMOS through SMUC.
 34++ 64C5                      ; Retry through the SMUC DFBA/FFBA index/data interface.
 35++ 64C5 CD C0 65             call    DS12887_CLOSE
